*** Settings ***
Documentation       [SUITE PURPOSE] CB010850-AA_7_UL-PRB_Blanking_Robustness
...                 Robustness test for CB010850:
...                 - Configured gNB to blank 26 PRBs in high edge
...                 - Attach 4 UEs and send mex UL throughput
...                 - When for the end of the current GP and check counter to ensure all PRB except the blanked
...                 PRB are used, check there is not call drop and BLER level
...                 - Detach UE
...                 - Online update gNB configuration to 26 PRBs blanked in low edge
...                 - Repeates above steps several times
...                 Test Case Scenario author   : yann.ah.herve@nokia.com
...                 Test Case Scenario contact  : yann.ah.herve@nokia.com
...                 Creation Date               : 31-Aug-2023
...                 Modification                : 25-Sep-2024 : Produce Scout data
...                 FB2420   blandine.garnier@nokia.com    suppression buildversion ds iphy


Library           OperatingSystem

Resource          ./resources/robot/CB010850_AB_keywords.robot
Resource          ../../../resources/SWENG/robot/Tools.robot
Resource          ../../../resources/SWENG/robot/Setup.robot
Resource          ../../../resources/SWENG/robot/SetConfig.robot
Resource          ../../../resources/SWENG/robot/KPIs.robot
Resource          ../../../resources/SWENG/robot/Syslogs.robot
Resource          ../../../resources/SWENG/robot/Hardening.robot
Resource          ../../../resources/SWENG/robot/WtsXmlConfig.robot


Force Tags                          CA_5G_SW_FR-Villarceaux    RRM
...                                 PY36
...                                 master_classicalbts_all    SBTS00       SBTS24R1
...                                 CONFIGURED    5G_RAN    RAN_5G    CRT

Suite Setup                         Suite Setup from scratch            listBackupFiles=${FD_ALL}
...                                                                     keepAllUeDataInCfgFile=${True}
Suite Teardown                      Suite Teardown

Test Setup                          CB0010850 Robustness Test Setup
Test Teardown                       CB0010850 Robustness Test Teardown

*** Variables ***

${scf_delta_config_10850_robustness}        testsuite/Paris/RRM/ET/CB010850/config/Delta_scf_CB010850_AA_Robustness.json
${delta_config_high_edge}                   testsuite/Paris/RRM/ET/CB010850/config/Delta_scf_High_Edge_CB010850_AA_Robustness.json
${delta_config_low_edge}                    testsuite/Paris/RRM/ET/CB010850/config/Delta_scf_Low_Edge_CB010850_AA_Robustness.json

${cb010850_Robustness_constraints}          testsuite/Paris/RRM/ET/CB010850/config/CB010850_AA_Robustness_constraints.csv
${resources_tolerance_file}                 testsuite/Paris/RRM/ET/CB010850/config/CB010850_resources_lack.csv

# UE capability with UE PTRS enabled
${UE_capa_with_PTRS}                        SEPARATOR=
...                                         E1A01000014F5E0302C0020840009041BB8987C2A1201360107FE618F28581C13018062280C0298C00283
...                                         E0C6B0C6D1D262A08FE5949328340105B260901831E31FF9863CA160703878099D87619D8760080060000
...                                         00000E0C00000000210600C72687C0390400000290400000A90400001292500001A6017036F236B748028
...                                         2000012CA4A080000CB29282000052CA4A080001CB29282000092CA4A480002A9652501340EAE91D5D0AA
...                                         9A55515DA816007801A01008000000000020040084

${trcColor}                                 Evaluate    "${CYAN}"
${defColor}                                 Evaluate    "${NORMAL}"
${OkColor}                                  Evaluate    "${GREEN}"

${nb_loops}                                 10
# In Mbps
${ul_tput_per_ue}                           45

# First UE id for FDD cell (cell3) with variant SANSA_FS_CPRI_CMWV_FDD+ECPRI_CMWV_TDD_AEQE
${ue_id_base_cell3}                         51

${traffic_duration}                         180s

${nbRobustnessUEs}                          4
@{SA_UE_List}

*** Keywords ***

CB0010850 Robustness Test Setup
    [Documentation]             Perform needed actions at the begining of a test case
    Dated Log New Line          Start Test Setup
    Init Trace color

CB0010850 Robustness Test Teardown
    [Documentation]             Perform needed actions at the end of a test case
    Test Teardown
    Restore Files               listFileDesc=${FD_ALL}

Init Trace color
    ${trcColor}                 Evaluate    "${CYAN}"
    ${defColor}                 Evaluate    "${NORMAL}"
    ${OkColor}                  Evaluate    "${GREEN}"
    Set Suite Variable          ${trcColor}
    Set Suite Variable          ${defColor}
    Set Suite Variable          ${OkColor}

CB010850_Robustness_Configuration
    [Documentation]               Dedicated KW to add use a delta commissioning file
    ...                           2 cells in TDD 100 MHz (cell1/cell2)
    ...                           2 cells in FDD 20 MHz (cell3/cell4) that will be moved to n25 band
    ...                           I can't reuse the Kw inside CB010850_AB_keywords.robot as it was designed for
    ...                           a TL with 2 FDD cells and IPHY configuration is not suitable for the new TL
    ...                           like SANSA_FS_CPRI_CMWV_FDD+ECPRI_CMWV_TDD_AEQE
    [Arguments]                   ${scf_delta_config_10850_robustness}     ${gnb_alias}

    # Open connection towards cOAM
    sbts_coam.connect_to          name=${gnb_alias}

    # Apply delta scf
    coam_parameter.perform_scf_delta_commission
    ...                           delta_file=${scf_delta_config_10850_robustness}
    ...                           connection=${gnb_alias}
    ...                           timeout=300

    OAM wait available

    sbts_coam.teardown            connection=${gnb_alias}

    GnbXmlTools.Get Data From Gnb TargetBD File        card_name=AHFII

    # Update IPHY GSCN to new value
    WtsXmlConfig.startSession           file=iphy
    WtsXmlConfig.setTextUsingIndex      //cardName                      AHFII           3
    WtsXmlConfig.setTextUsingIndex      //resourceBuildKey              LTX_AHFII       3
    WtsXmlConfig.setTextUsingIndex      //GSCN                          4907            3

    # update iphy.xml with swVersion and swFileKey values taken fomr GNB TargetBD_*.xml
    WtsXmlConfig.setTextUsingIndex      //version                        ${g_resource_swVersion}    3
    WtsXmlConfig.setTextUsingIndex      //bldVersion                     ${g_resource_swVersion}    3
    # WtsXmlConfig.setTextUsingIndex      //buildversion                   ${g_resource_swVersion}    3
    WtsXmlConfig.setTextUsingIndex      //software/file/name             ${g_resource_swFileKey}    3
    WtsXmlConfig.stopSession            file=iphy

    #Update gscn & nrarfcn and add PTRS support inside UE capabilities
    WtsCfgConfig.startSession
    #set tdd_cell =off
    ${oldValue}          getParam           prefix=set_cell id=3          param=nr_arfcn
    replaceValue         prefix=set_cell id=3
    ...                  param=nr_arfcn
    ...                  oldValue=${oldValue}
    ...                  newValue=${nrarfcnUl}:${nrarfcnDl}

    ${oldValue}          getParam           prefix=set_cell id=3          param=gscn
    replaceValue         prefix=set_cell id=3
    ...                  param=gscn
    ...                  oldValue=${oldValue}
    ...                  newValue=${gscn}

    ${oldValue}          getParam           prefix=set SA_UE_CAPABILITIES_FDD          param=SA_UE_CAPABILITIES_FDD
    replaceValue         prefix=set SA_UE_CAPABILITIES_FDD
    ...                  param=SA_UE_CAPABILITIES_FDD
    ...                  oldValue=${oldValue}
    ...                  newValue=${UE_capa_with_PTRS}

    WtsCfgConfig.stopSession

CB010850_Robustness_Scenario_Init
    [Documentation]                 KW used to initialise context for CB010850 robustness TC execution:
    ...                             Update SCF with suitable parameters by using a delta JSON file.

    Dated Log New Line                  ${trcColor}---> Starting gNB commissioning ${defColor}

    # Update SCF file and move to n25 band (TMO usage)
    CB010850_Robustness_Configuration   ${scf_delta_config_10850_robustness}            ${gnb_alias}

    Dated Log New Line                  ${trcColor}---> Restart TL ${defColor}
    Restart TL
    Dated Log New Line                  ${trcColor}---> WTS setup SA ${defColor}
    WTS Setup                           shouldUseLua=${False}
    # Cellsetup is now done, Sherpa can be enabled if needed
    Run Keyword If                      ${enable_sherpa} == ${True}           Activate Sherpa

    # Build UE list
    FOR        ${ue_id}      IN RANGE        0        ${nbRobustnessUEs}
        &{ue_in_list}=                  Copy dictionary     ${BASIC_UE_SA}
        ${ue_absolute_id}=              Evaluate            ${ue_id} + ${ue_id_base_cell3}
        Set To Dictionary               ${ue_in_list}       ue          ${ue_absolute_id}
        Set To Dictionary               ${ue_in_list}       pdu         1
        Append To List                  ${SA_UE_List}       ${ue_in_list}
    END

CB010850_Attach_All_UEs
    Dated Log New Line       ${trcColor}---> Attaching UEs ${defColor}
    FOR        ${current_ue}            IN         @{SA_UE_List}
        UE Register                     ue=${current_ue.ue}
        Launch PDU Session              ue=${current_ue.ue}    pdu=${current_ue.pdu}    gw=${current_ue.ue}
    END
    Dated Log New Line       ${trcColor}---> All needed UEs are now attached${defColor}

CB010850_Detach_All_UEs
    Dated Log New Line       ${trcColor}---> Detaching all UEs ${defColor}
    FOR        ${current_ue}             IN         @{SA_UE_List}
        UE Deregister           id=${current_ue.ue}
    END

CB010850_Update_Online_SCF
    [Documentation]               KW used to update blanking configuration online by using a delta SCF file.
    [Arguments]                   ${delta_scf}

    Dated Log New Line            Updating SCF parameters with file ${delta_scf}
    # Open connection towards cOAM
    sbts_coam.connect_to          name=${gnb_alias}
    Run Keywords                  coam_parameter.perform_scf_delta_commission
    ...                           delta_file=${delta_scf}
    ...                           connection=${gnb_alias}
    # Wait end of commissioning
    ...                           AND
    ...                           OAM wait available
    sbts_coam.teardown            connection=${gnb_alias}

CB010850 Run Scenario Once
    [Documentation]     One loop of the user scenario
    CB010850_Attach_All_UEs

    # Start UL traffic over all UEs
    Traffic UEs UL                  ueSettingList=${SA_UE_List}
    ...                             duration=${traffic_duration}        shouldBeStop=True      shouldBeCheck=False
    ...                             throughput=${ul_tput_per_ue}

    CB010850_Detach_All_UEs

*** Test Cases ***

[1]CB010850-AA_7_UL-PRB_Blanking_Robustness
    [Documentation]               Main entry. Perform gNB initialisation, endurance loop and KPIs/counters checks

    # Customise SCF, restart TL and perform cell setup
    #
    CB010850_Robustness_Scenario_Init

    CB010850 Run Scenario Once
    # First resources snapshot needs to be done AFTER first scenario loop execution
    ${initial_resources}                Get Resources

    FOR        ${loop}      IN RANGE        ${nb_loops}
        Dated Log New Line              ${trcColor}---> Starting loop ${loop} ${defColor}

        # Online update of UL blanking cconfiguration.
        Run Keyword If                  ${loop%2} == 1
        ...                             CB010850_Update_Online_SCF       ${delta_config_low_edge}
        ...                             ELSE
        ...                             CB010850_Update_Online_SCF       ${delta_config_high_edge}

        ${zoi}                          ZOI Start
        ${zoi_end_remain}=              ZOI Remaining Sec           ${zoi}
        ${start_loop_remaining}=        Evaluate                    ${zoi_end_remain} - ${GP_DEF}
        # To be sure to have a GP fully filled with the same events inside every loop and avoid changing KPIs/counters:
        # If ZOI start is T0, ZOI end is T0 + ${GUARD_DELAY_DEF} + ${GP_DEF} + ${PM_AVAIL_DELAY_DEF}
        # So, test is started at the beginning of the GP before ZOI end, so:
        # ZOI End - ${GP_DEF}
        # Ex. 1: ZOI start is 10h02 => ZOI End is 10h02 + 40s (GUARD_DELAY_DEF) + 1 GP + 1 mn (PM_AVAIL_DELAY_DEF)
        #        => Time for next GP for ZOI End is 10h11, so test is started at 10h06 and KPIs retrieved at 10h11
        # Ex. 2: ZOI start is 10h14:40s => ZOI End is 10h14:40 + 40s (GUARD_DELAY_DEF) + 1 GP + 1 mn (PM_AVAIL_DELAY_DEF)
        #        => Time for next GP for ZOI End is 10h26 as gaurd delay excedd thenext GP frontier,
        #        so test is started at 10h21 and KPIs retrieved at 10h26
        # And, test duration must not exceed 1 GP - 1 mn per loop
        Traced Sleep                    ${start_loop_remaining} seconds
        ...                             msg=before starting scenario

        CB010850 Run Scenario Once

        # Start CPRT, CPNRT, L2PS resource monitoring
        ${current_resources}            Get Resources

        # Compare resources between the beginning and end of the loop to see if there is no
        # resource lacking. Resource leak must be done after the end of each scenario loop
        # (see CB008661 for more details)
        ${resources_comparison}         Compare Resources With Tolerance        ${initial_resources}
        ...                                                                     ${current_resources}
        ...                                                                     ${resources_tolerance_file}
        Should Be Empty                 ${resources_comparison}

        Dated Log New Line               ${trcColor}=== Waiting for end of ZOI ${defColor}
        ZOI Wait End                     zoi=${zoi}

        # KPIs and counters checks
        ${pm_path}                      Counters.Collect PM files from BTS    ${LOG_PATH}/PM
        KPI Evaluate                    pmFile=${pm_path}
        ...                             constraintsFile=${cb010850_Robustness_constraints}
        ...                             failOnError=${True}

    END